WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.800
Minwoo: Can you ride a bike?

2
00:00:02.801 --> 00:00:06.966
Sally: Yes, I can.

3
00:00:06.967 --> 00:00:09.916
Sally: Peter, can you rollerblade?

4
00:00:09.917 --> 00:00:14.405
Peter: Yes, I can.

5
00:00:14.406 --> 00:00:17.541
Peter: Minwoo, can you rollerblade?

6
00:00:17.542 --> 00:00:19.913
Minwoo: No, I can't.

7
00:00:19.914 --> 00:00:25.232
Sally: Come on, Minwoo!

8
00:00:25.233 --> 00:00:30.738
Sally: Let's go!

